# ExecuteRecovery action (Figure 9 A in the paper)

# Goal definition
float64 linear_x       # linear velocity to publish (m/s)
float64 angular_z      # angular velocity to publish (rad/s)
float64 duration       # sampled time period the velocity combination is held (s)
float64 cmd_distance   # commanded distance between consecutive landmarks (m)
float64 yaw_angle      # recorded yaw angle of the landmark (rad)
---
# Result definition
float64 distance       # distance travelled while executing the goal (m)
---
# Feedback definition
std_msgs/String fbk_msg  # human readable progress message
